{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"私密的温柔忽然变得开阔庄严，感动、幸福与自豪同时涌起。\",\n      \"why\": \"S06、S08让他尝过不必强撑的温柔，S12又让他发现心酸回来时力量仍在；如今珍惜与站稳不必再二选一。\",\n      \"from\": [\"S06\", \"S08\", \"S12\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M10\", \"M21\", \"M45\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"这份充实继续涨满，忽然外涌成几乎来不及喘息的狂喜。\",\n      \"why\": \"温柔与自豪既已能够并立，力量便不只用于稳住自己，也能不设防地流向对所珍惜之物的欢欣，积蓄已久的劲头于是外涌。\",\n      \"from\": [\"S06\", \"S12\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M2\", \"M48\", \"M55\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"热烈渐退，身体终于能喘息，细微的不安却也重新浮起。\",\n      \"why\": \"S09所说的未定并未消失；兴奋退去让旧疑问重新可感，同时身体也终于不用维持最高强度。安静下来，不等于疑问已经解决。\",\n      \"from\": [\"S09\", \"S12\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M1\", \"M3\", \"M45\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"近乎静止后，最后一记忽然照亮心里，带来清醒而坚定的在乎。\",\n      \"why\": \"回落让结束变得具体，身体却在真正放下前猛然重新感到这份珍惜的分量；他确认的是它真实发生过，而不是未来已有保证。\",\n      \"from\": [\"S09\", \"S12\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M49\", \"M51\", \"M57\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他发现，最私密的温柔不必靠退后和收敛来保存，也能与昂扬的力量同时充分展开。\",\n    \"他开始发现，欢欣退去、未定重现，并不使刚才的幸福失效；真实经历过的分量不必靠它永久停留来证明。\"\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B5\",\n      \"why\": \"两种读法都能承载末尾骤然清醒的效果，但现有线索不足以判定它究竟是意志落定还是从梦中醒来，不宜替它选定具体寓意。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d2e00fce-f782-4817-8255-5570596e2a62", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T222922139108Z", "elapsed_seconds": 102.454, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T22:31:04.607052+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "66f9636daacaaa55d535cc96bbb941034223aad6909058a645d9f0cfad19974b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T222922139108Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "17426fce33093482a7a2d68ab024f31c5a8ceab3fc47497d79e04229752f72ca"}}}
